                {
                  "id": "h-right-dealer",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Choosing the Right Truck Parts and Service Dealer Matters",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "right-dealer"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-right-dealer-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not every truck parts and service dealer offers the same experience. Beyond having inventory available, the right dealership should understand the urgency behind every repair and maintenance appointment. At Sun State International, we believe customer service matters just as much as the parts themselves. Our team works hard to provide straightforward communication, experienced support, and dependable service for all makes and models that helps businesses stay on schedule.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-keep-running",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep Your Fleet Running Strong With Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "keep-running"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-running-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Commercial trucks experience wear every single day, but staying ahead of maintenance can help prevent major breakdowns and costly downtime. From international truck filters and brake components to cooling systems and driveline repairs, replacing worn parts early is one of the smartest ways to protect your fleet. Whether your trucks need preventative maintenance, diagnostics, or replacement parts, Sun State International is here to help. Schedule a service appointment today and let our experienced team help keep your fleet operating at its best.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
